graph TD
    A[Start: Launch App] --> B{Authenticated?}
    B -- No --> C[Auth Page: Login/Register]
    C --> D[Save/Verify Credentials in users.json]
    D --> B
    B -- Yes --> E[Data Integration Layer]
    E --> F[Load CSVs: Leads, Counselling, Apps, Enrollment]
    F --> G[Merge Data on Lead_ID]
    G --> H[Feature Engineering: Lead Times, Months, Binary Targets]
    H --> I[Dashboard Interface]
    I --> J[Sidebar Filters: City, Channel, Date, Course]
    J --> K[Tabbed Analytics Engine]
    
    subgraph "Analytics Tabs"
    K1[Overview: Trends & Landscape]
    K2[Marketing: Channel/City Performance]
    K3[Operations: Funnel Flow - Sankey]
    K4[Financials: Revenue Insights]
    K5[Predictive AI: Lead Scoring]
    K6[Scenario: Funnel Simulation]
    end

    K5 --> L[Random Forest Model Training]
    L --> M[Interactive Lead Scoring Result]
